size    28 80
cap     The floating-point trap module for a 68881 or 68882 coprocessor.  It
cap     registers as `math' too, edition 6, at less than half the size of the
cap     software version; load whichever suits your machine.
try     modinfo CMDS/math881
run     builtin cd /dd
wait    1
run     clear
wait    1
run     modinfo CMDS/math881
wait    8
